					"text": "lp.vera+ iterates p′ = p + r·f(p): the population p grows by r·f(p). Every bang computes the next value and sends it out. A float in the left inlet sets the growth rate r and bangs; a list sets a cycle of growth rates that are used in turn, one per step. f is a function of p, sinpi (sin(π·p)) by default.",
